{"id":"torrey:sabbath-the","source":"torrey","name":"Sabbath, The","slug":"sabbath-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Instituted by God — Ge 2:3.","refs":[["Gen",2,3,2,3]]},{"text":"Grounds of its institution — Ge 2:2,3; Ex 20:11.","refs":[["Gen",2,2,2,2],["Gen",2,3,2,3],["Exod",20,11,20,11]]},{"text":"The seventh day observed as — Ex 20:9-11.","refs":[["Exod",20,9,20,11]]},{"text":"Made for man — Mr 2:27.","refs":[["Mark",2,27,2,27]]},{"text":"Blessed. — Ge 2:3; Ex 20:11.","refs":[["Gen",2,3,2,3],["Exod",20,11,20,11]]},{"text":"Sanctified. — Ge 2:3; Ex 31:15.","refs":[["Gen",2,3,2,3],["Exod",31,15,31,15]]},{"text":"Hallowed. — Ex 20:11.","refs":[["Exod",20,11,20,11]]},{"text":"Commanded, to be kept. — Le 19:3,30.","refs":[["Lev",19,3,19,3],["Lev",19,30,19,30]]},{"text":"Commanded to be sanctified. — Ex 20:8.","refs":[["Exod",20,8,20,8]]},{"text":"Will have his goodness commemorated in the observance of. — De 5:15.","refs":[["Deut",5,15,5,15]]},{"text":"Shows favour in appointing. — Ne 9:14.","refs":[["Neh",9,14,9,14]]},{"text":"Shows considerate kindness in appointing. — Ex 23:12.","refs":[["Exod",23,12,23,12]]},{"text":"A sign of the covenant — Ex 31:13,17.","refs":[["Exod",31,13,31,13],["Exod",31,17,31,17]]},{"text":"A type of the heavenly rest — Heb 4:4,9.","refs":[["Heb",4,4,4,4],["Heb",4,9,4,9]]},{"text":"Is Lord of. — Mr 2:28.","refs":[["Mark",2,28,2,28]]},{"text":"Was accustomed to observe. — Lu 4:16.","refs":[["Luke",4,16,4,16]]},{"text":"Taught on. — Lu 4:31; 6:6.","refs":[["Luke",4,31,4,31],["Luke",6,6,6,6]]},{"text":"Servants and cattle should be allowed to rest upon — Ex 20:10; De 5:14.","refs":[["Exod",20,10,20,10],["Deut",5,14,5,14]]},{"text":"No manner of work to be done on — Ex 20:10; Le 23:3.","refs":[["Exod",20,10,20,10],["Lev",23,3,23,3]]},{"text":"No purchases to be made on — Ne 10:31; 13:15-17.","refs":[["Neh",10,31,10,31],["Neh",13,15,13,17]]},{"text":"No burdens to be carried on — Ne 13:19; Jer 17:21.","refs":[["Neh",13,19,13,19],["Jer",17